  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-021",
    "title": "：三方来使"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_108",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "归墟灵城崩塌后的第三天，三方来使同时抵达旧驿道。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第二枚残印升到半空后，整座灵脉城开始下雪。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3481,
          "end": 3481
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雪从没有屋顶的石楼间落下，洁白得不合时宜。每一片雪花落地，便化成一小团青光，钻入石缝。街上的无脸人纷纷抬头，空白的脸上第一次出现了类似表情的裂纹。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3483,
          "end": 3483
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城在重写自己。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3485,
          "end": 3485
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它会变成什么？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3487,
          "end": 3487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“取决于谁先拿到残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3489,
          "end": 3489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城外传来整齐的脚步声。玄霄宗追兵穿过青铜门，领头者正是灰布短褂的弟子。他手里提着一枚黑色令牌，令牌上刻着玄霄宗山门图。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3491,
          "end": 3491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，交出禁物。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3493,
          "end": 3493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向顾长离。第二盏灯仍在她怀里，金光已经变成暗红。她的手臂被石屑划开，血迹沿灯柄流下，却没有滴落，反而被灯罩吸收。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3495,
          "end": 3495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯给我。”灰布弟子说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3497,
          "end": 3497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它不属于玄霄宗。”顾长离答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3499,
          "end": 3499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封存工程由玄霄宗主持。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3501,
          "end": 3501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“清单上写的是三方共同。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3503,
          "end": 3503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰布弟子看见她手里的铜片，神色骤变：“那份清单从哪里来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3505,
          "end": 3505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“档房。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3507,
          "end": 3507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不可能。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3509,
          "end": 3509
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们可以裁名字，却裁不掉铜片。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3511,
          "end": 3511
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗弟子同时拔剑。剑光照亮雪幕，墙上的无脸人却在此时发出尖锐嘶鸣，黑色铜丝从窗后弹出，缠向所有人的脚踝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3513,
          "end": 3513
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰布弟子挥剑斩断铜丝，剑身立刻覆上一层青霜。他踉跄后退，令牌掉在地上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3515,
          "end": 3515
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜抓住陆照临：“去城心。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3517,
          "end": 3517
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印在那边。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3519,
          "end": 3519
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才要去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3521,
          "end": 3521
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们沿石阶向黑铁门奔跑。慧闻留在后方，以无相铜镜照住追兵。镜面中的玄霄宗弟子纷纷变成无脸人，彼此挥剑，竟看不清真正的目标。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3523,
          "end": 3523
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抱着第二盏灯走在最前。灯罩内的暗红光线向城心延伸，照出一串脚印。脚印左外侧有缺口，正是陆沉舟留下的鞋印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3525,
          "end": 3525
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他刚来过。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3527,
          "end": 3527
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "脚印停在黑铁门前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3529,
          "end": 3529
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门已经敞开，陆沉舟却不在。门后石厅中央悬着第二枚残印，残印下方是一盏巨大的青铜灯。灯座上刻着密密麻麻的名字，最上方三个已经被削平。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3531,
          "end": 3531
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临靠近灯座，掌心残印立刻与空中的石片共鸣。两枚残印之间拉出一道青线，青线尽头指向灯座最底部的暗槽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3533,
          "end": 3533
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把你的残印放进去。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3535,
          "end": 3535
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会发生什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3537,
          "end": 3537
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城会开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3539,
          "end": 3539
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也可能城会塌。”慧闻从后方走来，“两种结果都没有证据保证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3541,
          "end": 3541
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把第二盏灯放在地上：“那就先让灯停下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3543,
          "end": 3543
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯罩内的暗红光芒突然暴涨。石厅里的名字开始一行行亮起，已经被削平的地方也浮出模糊轮廓。陆照临看见“陆”字、“顾”字和“叶”字同时出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3545,
          "end": 3545
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜脸色变了：“有人在城心点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3547,
          "end": 3547
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3549,
          "end": 3549
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他没有灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3551,
          "end": 3551
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "地面裂开，裂缝中伸出一只手。手腕缠着黑色铜丝，掌心却握着一盏小小的白灯。那只手将白灯放进暗槽，青线立刻断裂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3553,
          "end": 3553
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灵脉城发出巨大的轰鸣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3555,
          "end": 3555
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有石楼同时倾斜，街道像被一只无形巨手揉皱。雪花从空中倒卷，露出灰黑色的天空。无脸人被铜丝拖向城心，窗框一扇接一扇碎裂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3557,
          "end": 3557
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印！”叶观澜喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3559,
          "end": 3559
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手抓住空中的第二枚残印。石片入手的一瞬间，掌心旧痕与它拼合，青光贯穿整条手臂。他看见无灯镇的低地、玄霄宗的废井、归墟灵城的城门，三处地方被同一条灵脉连接。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3561,
          "end": 3561
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“或者一个名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3579,
          "end": 3579
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离捡起破碎的灯罩，把仍在燃烧的灯芯踩灭。她的叔父面孔已经消失，地上只剩一小片灰烬。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3625,
          "end": 3625
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他真的让我把灯送回人间。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3627,
          "end": 3627
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会照做吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3629,
          "end": 3629
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先找到他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3631,
          "end": 3631
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看着崩塌的城门：“从今天起，玄霄宗不会再把你当成误入此地的弟子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-077",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3633,
          "end": 3633
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“那他们会把我当成什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3635,
          "end": 3635
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一把必须夺回去的钥匙。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3637,
          "end": 3637
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "旧墟落雪后，城里所有声音都被压低。陆照临和陆沉舟在废墟间寻找第二枚残印，雪下埋着一串铜铃。铃面刻有三方印记，轻轻一晃便引来远处的狼群。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-080",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3639,
          "end": 3639
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这一次，他没有删去任何人的犹豫。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-081",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3641,
          "end": 3641
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有回头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-082",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3643,
          "end": 3643
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯影照过纸页，留下新的空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-083",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3645,
          "end": 3645
        }
      }
    ],
